      "id": "claim_2e8a846a097f4063af5c525f79482ae9",
      "statement": "The NEPO ledger is immutable — there is no UPDATE or DELETE on the ledger table; corrections are inserted as new ADJUSTMENT rows via the trip adjustments endpoint and reference the original txn_type + txn_id; postEntry uses pg_advisory_xact_lock to serialize concurrent postings on the same entity and computes newBalance = prevBalance + credit - debit stored as numeric(15, 0).",
