    {
      "id": "claim_d4d62a1b1a3e4f2aa2c69b5ce1388116",
      "statement": "The ledger.entityType column is varchar(50) and entityId is integer with no foreign key by design — the ledger must outlive the entity (a deleted driver still has ledger history), and LedgerService.getEntityTypeKey maps entityType strings to integer keys (CUSTOMER=1, DRIVER=2, VENDOR=3, FORWARDER=4, CARRIER=5) used for advisory-lock deadlock prevention via lockEntities which sorts targets before acquiring pg_advisory_xact_lock.",
