      "id": "claim_e7c6e36411924664b8b12c7076c9f64e",
      "statement": "postTripLock is the canonical trip-locked-to-ledger seam (backend/src/services/ledger.service.ts:249): it validates ancillary fees in strict mode, sorts and locks all touched entities, then posts TRIP_REVENUE on the customer, DRIVER_SALARY on the driver, FUEL_EXPENSE on the supplier (split per allocation when multi-supplier/multi-price with explicit unitPrice), and EXTERNAL_CARRIER_COST when the carrier is external.",
