      "statement": "Penalties are not company expenses — they are salary deductions from the driver surfaced as Other Income in P&L; the flow creates a penalties row referencing penalty_reasons, transitions ACTIVE to CANCELED via a reversal, and on salary period close deducts from driver salary while posting a PENALTY ledger row on the driver entity.",
